---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
pageTitle: Andrew Estrada — Mechanical Engineer
description: Mechanical engineer with Formula SAE suspension design, manufacturing engineering internships, CNC machining, and NASA Student Launch experience. Design through testing for real hardware.
ogImage: /assets/images/projects/fsae-hero.jpg
---
<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="home-hero__media" aria-hidden="true">
    <img
      src="/assets/images/projects/fsae-hero.jpg"
      alt=""
      width="1920"
      height="1440"
      fetchpriority="high"
    >
  </div>
  <div class="container home-hero__content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Mechanical Engineering Portfolio</p>
    <h1>Andrew Estrada</h1>
    <p class="home-hero__role">Mechanical Engineer</p>
    <p class="lede">
      I design, analyze, machine, and test mechanical systems — with Formula SAE suspension development and manufacturing engineering internships as proof.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="button" href="/projects/">View engineering work</a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="{{ site.resume.pdf }}">Download resume</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="proof-strip reveal">
      <div class="proof-item">
        <strong>Design → Test</strong>
        <span>Full process ownership from CAD and analysis to fabrication and validation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <strong>Formula SAE</strong>
        <span>Front pushrod suspension, rocker design, ANSYS, CNC machining</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <strong>Manufacturing</strong>
        <span>Fixture design, Haas CNC production, QC, and Lean support</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <strong>B.S. ME</strong>
        <span>Northern Arizona University</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
        <h2>Engineering case studies</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Compact project write-ups with role clarity, process, constraints, and measurable results.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project-grid">
      {% for project in collections.featuredProjects %}
      <div class="reveal">{% include "components/project-card.njk" %}</div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="cta-row">
      <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">Browse all projects</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--surface">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Experience</p>
        <h2>Where the work happened</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/experience/">Full experience</a>
    </div>
    <div class="experience-grid">
      {% for item in experience %}
      {% if loop.index0 < 3 %}
      <article class="experience-card reveal">
        <div class="experience-card__top">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">{{ item.type }}</p>
            <h3>{{ item.role }}</h3>
            <p class="experience-card__org">{{ item.org }}</p>
          </div>
          {% if item.logo %}
          <img class="experience-card__logo" src="{{ item.logo }}" alt="{{ item.org }} logo" width="160" height="48" loading="lazy">
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <p>{{ item.summary }}</p>
        {% if item.project %}
        <a class="text-link" href="{{ item.project }}">Related project</a>
        {% endif %}
      </article>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Capabilities</p>
        <h2>Tools used on real hardware</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Skills shown in the context of design, manufacturing, and testing — not as a keyword dump.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="skills-grid">
      {% for group in skills.groups %}
      <div class="skill-group reveal">
        <h3>{{ group.title }}</h3>
        <ul>
          {% for skill in group.items %}
          <li>{{ skill }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--surface">
  <div class="container approach-panel reveal">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Approach</p>
      <h2>Built for manufacturability and validation</h2>
      <p>
        My strongest projects start with geometry and constraints, move through analysis, and end with parts I can machine, assemble, and test. That loop is the through-line across Formula SAE, internship fixture work, and rocket systems.
      </p>
      <ol class="process-list">
        <li><strong>01</strong><span>Define loads, packaging, and manufacturing limits early.</span></li>
        <li><strong>02</strong><span>Iterate CAD and analysis until the design is both strong and buildable.</span></li>
        <li><strong>03</strong><span>Machine, assemble, instrument, and compare results to the model.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="button" href="/about/">About Andrew</a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <img
      src="/assets/images/portrait.jpg"
      alt="Portrait of Andrew Estrada"
      width="1276"
      height="1920"
      loading="lazy"
    >
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="final-cta reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Looking for a mechanical engineer who builds hardware?</h2>
        <p>
          Open to mechanical design, manufacturing, tooling, test, and product-development roles where CAD, analysis, and shop-floor execution all matter.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="button" href="{{ site.resume.pdf }}">Resume PDF</a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email Andrew</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
